Package: CALMeR
Type: Package
Title: Context-Aware Long-read MAPQ Rescuer
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Sowmya", "Parthiban", email = "your.email@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Filters BAM files from long-read transcriptome alignments by
    flagging reads whose MAPQ is anomalously low given transcript-level
    structural features (number of isoforms, transcript length, GC content,
    percent covered). Fits a Beta-Inflated (BEINF) regression model on a
    user-specified subset of reads, then computes randomized quantile
    residuals (RQR) on the full BAM and flags reads with low residuals using
    a MAD- or z-score-based threshold. Outputs a filtered BAM file, a TSV of
    flagged reads, and a model diagnostic report.
